{"5319550":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"文字刷宝录 Text Loot Codex","steam_appid":5319550,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5439300],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Text Loot Codex, characters, enemies, projectiles, and danger warnings are all made of text. You must dodge attacks on a constantly moving battlefield, defeat enemy hordes and bosses, and then find the next core piece for your build among the loot scattered everywhere.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lone Wolf or With Your Teammates<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adventure solo, or play online co-op with up to 4 players. The party shares challenge progress, and all players gain the same amount of XP when monsters are killed.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let Loot Change Your Playstyle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment has random affixes and different rarities, and legendary equipment also has unique effects. Compare equipment stats, use currency to modify items, and let every map run potentially bring new synergies.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Skills and Talents<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a melee, ranged, or spell class, and socket active, support, and aura skill stones into your equipment. Pair them with each class's talent paths to gradually develop your own combat style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Ever Deeper<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through five chapters of the main story and stage bosses, and collect maps with different affixes. After completing the main story, enter the Chaos Gate and choose your next challenge from three paths. You can also enter the Testing Grounds to test the strength of your build.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Text Loot Codex, characters, enemies, projectiles, and danger warnings are all made of text. You must dodge attacks on a constantly moving battlefield, defeat enemy hordes and bosses, and then find the next core piece for your build among the loot scattered everywhere.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lone Wolf or With Your Teammates<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adventure solo, or play online co-op with up to 4 players. The party shares challenge progress, and all players gain the same amount of XP when monsters are killed.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let Loot Change Your Playstyle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment has random affixes and different rarities, and legendary equipment also has unique effects. Compare equipment stats, use currency to modify items, and let every map run potentially bring new synergies.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Skills and Talents<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a melee, ranged, or spell class, and socket active, support, and aura skill stones into your equipment. Pair them with each class's talent paths to gradually develop your own combat style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Ever Deeper<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through five chapters of the main story and stage bosses, and collect maps with different affixes. After completing the main story, enter the Chaos Gate and choose your next challenge from three paths. You can also enter the Testing Grounds to test the strength of your build.<\/p>","short_description":"《Text Loot Codex》 is a loot-driven action RPG where the battlefield is built from text. Position, dodge, and cast abilities, then collect loot to forge a build that’s uniquely yours. You might just be the next Chaos Overlord!","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5319550\/170d0e56bc367515c8e5ef7eb4ec3242473d193b\/header.jpg?t=1793753837","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5319550\/d19960a3343fd53febd5cef23d8b3476bc1b427d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793753837","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5319550\/d19960a3343fd53febd5cef23d8b3476bc1b427d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793753837","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-750, 2.67 GHz \/ AMD A12-9800<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon HD 7770<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-2300, 2.80 GHz \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 \/ AMD Radeon R9 270X<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["棱镜工作室"],"publishers":["棱镜工作室"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":299,"final":269,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$2.99","final_formatted":"$2.69"},"packages":[1838361],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy 文字刷宝录 Text Loot Codex","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1838361,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"文字刷宝录 Text Loot Codex - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$2.99<\/span> $2.69","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":269}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},